WEBVTT

00:01:58.243 --> 00:02:01.079
So where's the target?

00:02:01.788 --> 00:02:03.790
That's the dealer's hideout.

00:02:04.541 --> 00:02:05.375
Disgusting.

00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:07.377
He lives there?

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:08.503
Fuck 'em up good!

00:02:13.675 --> 00:02:14.509
What?

00:02:18.847 --> 00:02:19.848
The fuck are you?

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:31.484
Seriously?

00:02:31.568 --> 00:02:32.861
Awesome!

00:02:33.611 --> 00:02:35.947
Are these guys dead?

00:02:36.030 --> 00:02:39.200
They're not dead,
but they're basket cases now.

00:02:42.745 --> 00:02:44.205
Here's your share.

00:02:44.289 --> 00:02:47.041
That's the last time we'll work with you.

00:02:47.542 --> 00:02:49.544
What do you mean by that?

00:02:49.627 --> 00:02:52.297
You scare us, girl.

00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:59.178
Don't take it the wrong way!
To us, that kind of power is… You know…

00:03:00.388 --> 00:03:01.472
Jerks.

00:03:05.560 --> 00:03:06.394
Yeah.

00:03:06.978 --> 00:03:08.396
Let's split the haul evenly.

00:03:09.397 --> 00:03:12.025
You're that chick Kasey, aren't you?

00:03:12.108 --> 00:03:15.820
I heard you turned all your pals
into basket cases over money.

00:03:16.696 --> 00:03:18.865
What? That's disgusting. I never did that.

00:03:19.866 --> 00:03:20.867
Is that right?

00:03:22.452 --> 00:03:24.412
Sorry, but I ain't working with you.

00:03:28.958 --> 00:03:30.960
Fuck off, you big wuss!

00:03:37.258 --> 00:03:38.843
Don't hate yourself.

00:03:40.178 --> 00:03:41.304
Lay down some rules.

00:03:42.597 --> 00:03:45.141
What's with you? Buzz off, old man.

00:03:46.351 --> 00:03:48.686
Your power is a treasure
that only you have.

00:03:49.646 --> 00:03:50.939
How'd you know about my power?

00:03:51.481 --> 00:03:52.982
Love it.

00:03:53.066 --> 00:03:54.817
There's no need to hate it.

00:03:55.401 --> 00:03:59.489
But lay down rules
for who to use it on and who not to.

00:04:00.073 --> 00:04:01.908
Quit your lecturing!

00:04:02.617 --> 00:04:07.830
Then only work with people
who can intuitively understand you.

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:10.750
That makes no sense.

00:04:11.292 --> 00:04:12.293
Enough of the lecture.

00:04:13.419 --> 00:04:15.838
You already understand what I mean.

00:04:18.132 --> 00:04:19.592
You're freakin' disgusting.

00:04:19.676 --> 00:04:20.593
So long.

00:04:33.564 --> 00:04:34.983
I've got a good job for you.

00:04:35.900 --> 00:04:38.486
It's something that only you can do.

00:04:39.195 --> 00:04:41.281
You understand, don't you?

00:04:42.573 --> 00:04:44.993
I think I just might understand.

00:04:59.132 --> 00:05:01.175
There we go.

00:05:01.259 --> 00:05:02.343
Honey. Sign the card…

00:05:03.011 --> 00:05:03.845
What's wrong?

00:05:03.928 --> 00:05:05.805
Oh, sure.

00:05:14.856 --> 00:05:15.982
There you go.

00:05:17.066 --> 00:05:19.360
Are you on your honeymoon?

00:05:19.444 --> 00:05:20.945
Can you tell?

00:05:21.029 --> 00:05:23.364
Congratulations, Mr. and Mrs. Brown.

00:05:23.448 --> 00:05:25.283
Welcome to the Plaza Hotel.

00:05:26.576 --> 00:05:27.660
Thanks.

00:05:31.331 --> 00:05:34.167
Sweetheart! Did you see the bathroom?

00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:37.128
There are mirrors everywhere!
Talk about sexy!

00:05:38.087 --> 00:05:39.005
Really?

00:05:39.589 --> 00:05:40.465
That's nice.

00:05:41.257 --> 00:05:43.885
What's that? Mr. and Mrs. Brown?

00:05:45.053 --> 00:05:46.971
But we're just a pretend married couple.

00:05:47.055 --> 00:05:49.307
Yeah, we are now, but…

00:05:49.390 --> 00:05:50.475
Do you mean…

00:05:51.059 --> 00:05:54.270
Around this time tomorrow,
it won't be pretend anymore.

00:05:55.813 --> 00:05:56.814
Kasey.

00:05:58.524 --> 00:06:00.777
Looks like we'll need to reserve a church.

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:01.903
Johnny!

00:06:01.986 --> 00:06:05.823
Here. Tomorrow, our futures change.

00:06:05.907 --> 00:06:07.241
Let's celebrate early.

00:06:07.867 --> 00:06:09.577
We'll get out of this racket.

00:06:10.161 --> 00:06:14.624
We won't be spending our lives
in Supermax like those other villains.

00:06:27.345 --> 00:06:29.097
I won't ever let you go.

00:06:29.889 --> 00:06:30.973
Johnny…

00:06:31.557 --> 00:06:33.184
I'm gettin' an erection!

00:06:33.267 --> 00:06:34.393
Oh, you!

00:06:34.477 --> 00:06:36.562
Raw's okay, right, Kasey?

00:06:36.646 --> 00:06:38.356
Hey! Get the phone!

00:06:39.857 --> 00:06:40.775
Goddammit!

00:06:42.235 --> 00:06:47.073
Listen well! Get plenty of sleep
and don't drink a drop of liquor.

00:06:47.156 --> 00:06:48.199
If you…

00:06:48.950 --> 00:06:49.784
Johnny?

00:06:50.326 --> 00:06:51.244
What?

00:06:51.869 --> 00:06:53.037
He hung up on me.

00:06:55.331 --> 00:06:56.541
For god's sake!

00:06:57.291 --> 00:06:58.960
Chelsea?

00:07:00.378 --> 00:07:02.296
This place never changes.

00:07:04.966 --> 00:07:07.343
Here's to the skyscrapers.

00:07:14.058 --> 00:07:14.934
I can't sleep!

00:07:26.696 --> 00:07:27.822
Not bad.

00:07:38.416 --> 00:07:40.042
This carpet's really thick.

00:07:40.126 --> 00:07:40.960
Cut it out!

00:07:41.043 --> 00:07:42.295
They'll see through us!

00:07:42.378 --> 00:07:43.921
What will they see?

00:07:44.547 --> 00:07:46.007
That we're yokels.

00:07:46.757 --> 00:07:47.800
That's true.

00:07:48.968 --> 00:07:50.178
That hurts!

00:07:50.261 --> 00:07:51.179
Sorry.

00:07:52.388 --> 00:07:54.307
Cut it out! They'll see through us!

00:07:55.725 --> 00:07:56.893
That's true.

00:08:03.232 --> 00:08:04.692
Sheesh…

00:08:15.620 --> 00:08:19.832
Mommy! Wake up! It moved!

00:08:21.209 --> 00:08:22.835
<i>The last train will be departing soon.</i>

00:08:24.837 --> 00:08:26.589
Ouch! My back's killing me.

00:08:27.465 --> 00:08:29.133
Where's the darn hotel?

00:08:31.302 --> 00:08:33.012
Nine more hours?

00:08:47.693 --> 00:08:48.694
I'll take two.

00:08:49.278 --> 00:08:50.655
Two coming right up.

00:08:50.738 --> 00:08:52.198
Mustard?

00:08:52.281 --> 00:08:53.449
Thank you for coming.

00:08:57.745 --> 00:08:59.163
Thanks.

00:09:00.957 --> 00:09:02.875
Give me a hand out here.

00:09:05.169 --> 00:09:06.879
What is this? A one-man operation?

00:09:10.174 --> 00:09:11.008
Say…

00:09:11.717 --> 00:09:16.597
If it looks like those guys will kill me,
make me see a pleasant hallucination.

00:09:16.681 --> 00:09:21.018
I'll take you to Wonderland
with a nice little rabbit.

00:09:21.102 --> 00:09:22.353
That sounds nice.

00:09:22.436 --> 00:09:24.480
Where do you want her to take you?

00:09:25.439 --> 00:09:27.316
You want to be Christopher Robin?

00:09:28.109 --> 00:09:29.193
No, thanks.

00:09:29.277 --> 00:09:30.653
I don't need any hallucinations.

00:09:31.946 --> 00:09:37.118
You see, I want to see
the real Kasey up to the very end.

00:09:39.870 --> 00:09:40.997
Right?

00:09:42.039 --> 00:09:43.207
Oh, you.

00:09:43.749 --> 00:09:44.625
Sorry.

00:09:44.709 --> 00:09:47.670
I see you're already off in wonderland.

00:09:52.049 --> 00:09:53.301
<i>Look!</i>

00:09:59.098 --> 00:10:00.474
It's The Utopian!

00:10:03.227 --> 00:10:04.770
And that's Paragon!

00:10:04.854 --> 00:10:07.064
And of course, he's with Ruby Red.

00:10:07.148 --> 00:10:08.232
How lovely!

00:10:08.316 --> 00:10:10.192
They make such a great couple!

00:10:10.276 --> 00:10:12.194
What? Where's Brainwave?

00:10:12.278 --> 00:10:15.781
Didn't you know?
He's in China to get some kind of award.

00:10:15.865 --> 00:10:17.700
What? That's too bad.

00:10:19.285 --> 00:10:22.788
<i>Of course,
the most popular is The Utopian,</i>

00:10:22.872 --> 00:10:24.832
<i>the leader of The Union of Justice.</i>

00:10:24.915 --> 00:10:29.503
<i>And for their regular meeting
to be held today, Lady Liberty,</i>

00:10:29.587 --> 00:10:33.341
<i>The Flare II, Paragon, Gladiator,</i>

00:10:33.424 --> 00:10:37.386
<i>Molecule Master,
and other superheroes have gathered here.</i>

00:10:37.470 --> 00:10:41.891
<i>There's a huge crowd in front of the HQ
hoping to catch sight of them.</i>

00:10:42.516 --> 00:10:45.436
<i>And who's the final arrival?
Oh, there he is!</i>

00:10:45.519 --> 00:10:48.230
<i>It's Praetorian.
His popularity has skyrocketed lately!</i>

00:10:48.314 --> 00:10:53.444
<i>That will be all from me here.
I'll send it back to the studio.</i>

00:11:07.291 --> 00:11:08.876
Time to start the operation.

00:11:13.422 --> 00:11:14.757
"Thunder Fighter"?

00:11:15.549 --> 00:11:16.634
Never heard of him.

00:11:16.717 --> 00:11:18.386
Hold on a second!

00:11:18.469 --> 00:11:22.848
Oh, look at this!
It's The Necromancer's tomb.

00:11:22.932 --> 00:11:24.517
Let's get a picture of this.

00:11:24.600 --> 00:11:25.518
Okay!

00:11:26.602 --> 00:11:28.354
This will get tons of likes!

00:11:32.233 --> 00:11:34.068
Hey! What's happening?

00:11:41.575 --> 00:11:42.451
What's that?

00:11:42.535 --> 00:11:43.369
This is nuts.

00:12:26.203 --> 00:12:28.414
The Necromancer…

00:12:28.497 --> 00:12:30.708
Did you get a photo?

00:12:30.791 --> 00:12:31.667
No.

00:12:35.045 --> 00:12:37.047
We're patrolling Valley Street now.

00:12:37.965 --> 00:12:39.925
You see what?

00:12:40.551 --> 00:12:41.719
That's ridiculous!

00:12:41.802 --> 00:12:44.346
Leave those jokes for Halloween.

00:12:46.182 --> 00:12:50.603
Fine! Now just calm down!
I'll get backup! What? Bicycles?

00:12:50.686 --> 00:12:51.729
Hey!

00:12:52.688 --> 00:12:54.523
-Holy shit!
-Are you serious?

00:12:59.862 --> 00:13:02.948
This isn't the set of a movie!

00:13:03.032 --> 00:13:07.870
But it's still just like <i>Dawn of the Dead!</i>
This is unbelievable!

00:13:07.953 --> 00:13:09.205
Wait! What's that?

00:13:09.788 --> 00:13:13.042
<i>That zombie is flying!</i>

00:13:13.959 --> 00:13:16.962
<i>What? In Pittsburgh? There's a what?</i>

00:13:18.380 --> 00:13:21.800
<i>We're interrupting this live broadcast
to bring you breaking news.</i>

00:13:21.884 --> 00:13:25.679
<i>The Necromancer is attacking
the downtown Pittsburgh area.</i>

00:13:25.763 --> 00:13:27.181
<i>The Necromancer was</i>

00:13:27.264 --> 00:13:31.310
<i>a notorious supervillain who used his
cursed powers to commit heinous crimes.</i>

00:13:31.393 --> 00:13:36.065
<i>But he died nine years ago
and was buried in a tomb in Pittsburgh…</i>

00:13:36.148 --> 00:13:37.525
Look at that!

00:13:39.902 --> 00:13:42.238
The superheroes of

00:13:42.321 --> 00:13:47.368
our Union of Justice
have all just flown off for Pittsburg!

00:13:51.038 --> 00:13:52.373
That worked out well.

00:13:54.166 --> 00:13:55.584
So this is their HQ?

00:13:55.668 --> 00:13:56.961
Dang!

00:13:57.044 --> 00:13:59.922
I've wanted to come here
ever since I was a kid!

00:14:00.005 --> 00:14:01.048
Whoa!

00:14:01.131 --> 00:14:02.800
It's just like it looks on TV!

00:14:03.634 --> 00:14:05.678
Time to start our operation too.

00:14:06.262 --> 00:14:07.930
Don't get scared, Sammy.

00:14:08.013 --> 00:14:10.474
You too, buddy.
I hope you went to the bathroom.

00:14:10.558 --> 00:14:12.643
Yes, that's very important.

00:14:12.726 --> 00:14:13.894
Isn't that right, Johnny?

00:14:13.978 --> 00:14:16.564
Don't talk about that. Let's go!

00:14:18.482 --> 00:14:22.820
<i>The plan is perfect.
Once we see the superheroes have left,</i>

00:14:24.029 --> 00:14:26.782
<i>we'll first disable the security system.</i>

00:14:28.075 --> 00:14:32.288
<i>Beforehand, we'll fabricate
security camera footage.</i>

00:14:33.455 --> 00:14:38.752
<i>Once we're done with our work,
nobody will even know that we were there.</i>

00:14:39.336 --> 00:14:41.130
<i>That's when Kasey comes in.</i>

00:14:41.213 --> 00:14:43.632
<i>After that,
we just need to find the spoils.</i>

00:14:43.716 --> 00:14:46.343
<i>But the time for doing that is limited.</i>

00:14:46.844 --> 00:14:49.597
<i>It all depends on how well their act goes.</i>

00:15:06.155 --> 00:15:08.073
That's freakin' insane!

00:15:08.157 --> 00:15:10.075
<i>What is this, Tour de Pittsburgh?</i>

00:15:13.329 --> 00:15:16.957
<i>But fast-moving zombies are so passé now.</i>

00:15:18.042 --> 00:15:20.586
This would blow Romero away.

00:15:20.669 --> 00:15:23.047
Okay! In that case…

00:15:23.714 --> 00:15:25.174
Let there be light!

00:15:36.477 --> 00:15:38.646
Neither of us needs any special effects.

00:15:40.439 --> 00:15:42.608
It's the end of the world, ya know.

00:15:42.691 --> 00:15:43.525
Look.

00:15:44.526 --> 00:15:45.486
Here they come.

00:15:45.569 --> 00:15:47.738
That's superheroes for you.

00:15:48.322 --> 00:15:51.241
They're quick
when it comes to flashy trouble.

00:15:51.325 --> 00:15:52.242
Yeah.

00:15:52.326 --> 00:15:54.328
Now's when the real fun starts.

00:15:55.162 --> 00:15:57.539
-Later, dudes.
-I'll have caramel macchiato.

00:15:57.623 --> 00:15:59.750
Are you sure? Don't you have diabetes?

00:16:03.337 --> 00:16:06.090
All right, where is it? Find it!

00:16:06.966 --> 00:16:10.594
Hey!
This is Mister Rooster's Sword of Blood!

00:16:11.679 --> 00:16:15.057
Over here is Thunder Fighter's buckle!
Awesome!

00:16:15.140 --> 00:16:18.143
Seriously? Thunder Fighter?
Maybe they've got his mask too!

00:16:18.227 --> 00:16:20.813
Don't get distracted by that dumb stuff.

00:16:20.896 --> 00:16:22.231
It ain't dumb!

00:16:22.314 --> 00:16:25.192
They're villain wrestlers
that we villains look up to!

00:16:25.275 --> 00:16:27.027
Listen! What we're after is--

00:16:27.111 --> 00:16:30.864
Yeah, yeah. It's that thing
Count Orlok wants so badly.

00:16:31.448 --> 00:16:32.741
That cursed helmet, right?

00:16:33.325 --> 00:16:34.660
Hurry it up.

00:16:34.743 --> 00:16:36.704
I'm gradually losing my concentration.

00:16:36.787 --> 00:16:38.914
It'll be a piece of cake, partner.

00:16:39.498 --> 00:16:41.166
I'm counting on you, partner.

00:16:42.376 --> 00:16:43.627
This reminds me of

00:16:43.711 --> 00:16:46.964
the time we broke into that
creepy Chinese mobster's wine cellar.

00:16:48.007 --> 00:16:50.551
Don't screw up again
like you did that time.

00:16:55.305 --> 00:16:57.099
Time out. I gotta use the restroom.

00:16:57.182 --> 00:16:59.977
What? Are you kidding? You idiot!

00:17:02.938 --> 00:17:05.232
Oh, um…

00:17:05.816 --> 00:17:06.775
Who are…

00:17:12.448 --> 00:17:13.574
I must be seeing things.

00:17:14.575 --> 00:17:15.409
What?

00:17:16.827 --> 00:17:19.496
How's this? They're worth 100,000 dollars.

00:17:21.290 --> 00:17:23.792
But how come that guy didn't notice me?

00:17:23.876 --> 00:17:25.878
I made him hallucinate.

00:17:25.961 --> 00:17:28.797
Honey, you can do that? I never knew!

00:17:28.881 --> 00:17:31.967
That's right.
Want me to make you hallucinate too?

00:17:32.885 --> 00:17:35.721
Yeah, maybe not. I'm already

00:17:37.222 --> 00:17:39.641
totally spellbound by you.

00:17:42.436 --> 00:17:44.605
You're not afraid of my power?

00:17:46.231 --> 00:17:48.275
Why? It's totally cool!

00:17:54.907 --> 00:17:59.787
Oh, shut up. I got the runs that day
because of the <i>tom yum</i> the day before.

00:18:01.038 --> 00:18:02.331
What? There it is!

00:18:02.414 --> 00:18:04.458
We've found it! Ghost!

00:18:05.084 --> 00:18:07.836
Right. So this is the magical helmet?

00:18:07.920 --> 00:18:09.505
Leave this to me.

00:18:15.260 --> 00:18:16.762
Must be yesterday's <i>jjigae</i>.

00:18:19.306 --> 00:18:21.850
Praetorian! Good afternoon.

00:18:21.934 --> 00:18:24.144
Huh? Is the meeting already over?

00:18:24.228 --> 00:18:25.562
No, not at all.

00:18:25.646 --> 00:18:30.442
They all left to handle some
serious trouble in Pittsburgh right now.

00:18:31.151 --> 00:18:32.069
Pittsburgh?

00:18:33.737 --> 00:18:36.156
The Necromancer and zombies?

00:18:36.240 --> 00:18:38.367
You're going too, right?

00:18:38.450 --> 00:18:40.869
What power do you have right now?

00:18:41.537 --> 00:18:42.663
Now?

00:18:48.168 --> 00:18:51.630
<i>Now, I can hear people
even though I can't see them.</i>

00:18:52.631 --> 00:18:56.802
<i>Really? Sharp ears! That's amazing!</i>

00:19:00.180 --> 00:19:01.682
Let's hightail it

00:19:01.765 --> 00:19:04.643
before The Utopian and the others
realize they're fake zombies.

00:19:05.227 --> 00:19:08.147
Yes. It's a very useful power.

00:19:09.356 --> 00:19:12.151
What? Where are you going?

00:19:14.862 --> 00:19:16.405
To the scene of the crime.

00:19:24.246 --> 00:19:25.330
Am I hallucinating?

00:19:29.585 --> 00:19:31.962
Don't think you can hide from me!

00:19:37.259 --> 00:19:39.011
-Shit!
-What?

00:19:39.720 --> 00:19:40.929
You're kidding me.

00:19:41.513 --> 00:19:42.723
Unbelievable.

00:19:43.307 --> 00:19:44.474
It wasn't my fault!

00:19:45.142 --> 00:19:46.852
You morons.

00:19:46.935 --> 00:19:49.688
Why would we display the real thing here?

00:19:49.771 --> 00:19:50.772
What?

00:19:51.440 --> 00:19:54.193
It's just like
the National Museum of Natural History.

00:19:54.276 --> 00:19:56.778
All these things are replicas.

00:19:56.862 --> 00:20:00.741
The real ones are stored in
an enormous secure underground vault.

00:20:01.992 --> 00:20:02.993
It's a fake?

00:20:03.076 --> 00:20:04.244
That was a close call.

00:20:04.328 --> 00:20:05.537
Oh, it was just a prank.

00:20:05.621 --> 00:20:08.207
Don't scare us like that.

00:20:08.290 --> 00:20:10.834
The real one's in the basement! Ghost!

00:20:10.918 --> 00:20:12.544
I'll get it this time!

00:20:13.503 --> 00:20:15.172
We're almost out of time!

00:20:17.132 --> 00:20:18.425
What kind of trick is this?

00:20:24.306 --> 00:20:25.474
No!

00:20:27.392 --> 00:20:32.439
<i>It feels like someone's inside my head,
like in San Francisco.</i>

00:20:33.398 --> 00:20:34.233
There she is!

00:20:36.526 --> 00:20:37.736
Kasey!

00:20:44.868 --> 00:20:46.787
I've met you somewhere before.

00:20:50.707 --> 00:20:52.793
You've got the wrong guy…

